Harmony Games Calendar.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 3, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "1fcdf3571d0948cc5ba5afe3ff91e132", "ts": "1757071309.116309", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0033_SLACK_ID", "text": "And reminder from me. I'll be off next week: 8th-12th September", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 4, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "b6f41a2e91c8b6bb2a0d0aabb317a0e7", "ts": "1757568953.301969", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0008_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey Team, I'll be out Tuesday the 16th. Will be out of pocket all morning (my time). But will be reachable in the afternoon.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 2, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "cfe62ad3d41cbcc9fda46e01344f32fa", "ts": "1757690701.132029", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey, guys, I have a doctor appointment, I'll be afk a couple hours and I'll miss today's sync. My update is I merged main branch yesterday and I started checking [PERSON_NAME_0029]'s VFX integration to use them on CollectAndWin transitions when collecting token, claiming reward and end level screen.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 3, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "2e176d7fccaddc7a7e57dcdba0d0be08", "ts": "1757704290.799329", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "text": "<!here>\n\nWe finalized the dev pipeline for the beta. We cut anything truly net-new and left time for bug fixing and content polish. If we ship *Win & Collect*, *Reward Animations*, *Season Pass*, and *Infinite HP Boss Mode by end of next week*, the beta goals are achievable. We\u2019ll review on Monday in planning, but sharing now so owners can align. Every item has a clear *product owner*; if you\u2019re unsure, please sync with the owner and your ENG counterpart.\n\n*Beta target: Sep 30.* Let\u2019s keep the date and Push through the finish line.\n*Scope:* Finish current pipeline and balance passes. Only net-new feature is *Axe Arena* ported from Domino Delights.\n\nDesign, content, and balance\n\u2022 *Adaptive difficulty tiering into player buckets* ([PERSON_NAME_0054], Blake): define buckets, parameters, rollout plan.\n\u2022 *Revisit all boosters* ([PERSON_NAME_0054], [PERSON_NAME_0120]): balance effects, costs, rarity, shop bundles.\n\u2022 *Adjust airstrike balance* ([PERSON_NAME_0054], [PERSON_NAME_0040]): power, cooldown, economy impact.\n\u2022 *Add quests and rebalance quest rewards* (Leonard, Douglas): reward tables and early-game pacing.\n\u2022 *Shop inventory review and additions* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], [PERSON_NAME_0054]): SKUs, prices, rotations.\n\u2022 *Pre-level dialogue change* ([PERSON_NAME_0054], [PERSON_NAME_0040], Martin): copy, triggers, UI flow - engineer to be assigned once design finalizes.\n\u2022 *Bot scoring improvements* ([PERSON_NAME_0050], Douglas): scoring rules for fair challenge bands.\n\u2022 *300 manmade levels for D1\u2013D7 depth* ([PERSON_NAME_0040]): publishable set covering D1\u2013D7.\nEngineering: game client\n\u2022 *Reward animations VFX polish* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], Marcus, [PERSON_NAME_0029]): hook to reward events, ensure smooth performance.\n\u2022 *Win & Collect flow* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], [PERSON_NAME_0067]): finalize UX, edge cases, analytics hooks.\n\u2022 *Infinite HP Boss Mode* ([PERSON_NAME_0054], [PERSON_NAME_0120]): difficulty tables, UI states, completion logic.\n\u2022 *Google and Apple login* ([PERSON_NAME_0050], [PERSON_NAME_0120]): auth flow, account link, error handling.\n\u2022 *Minor bug fixes* ([PERSON_NAME_0050]): ship the beta triage list.\nEngineering: live ops and monetization\n\u2022 *Season Pass integration* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], [PERSON_NAME_0022]): entitlement checks, mission hooks, reward grants.\n\u2022 *Rewarded ads surfaces* ([PERSON_NAME_0092]; support from [PERSON_NAME_0054], [PERSON_NAME_0120]): placements, frequency caps, failover.\n\u2022 *Pop-up offers via Harmony Games Engine* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], Blake, [PERSON_NAME_0120]): targeting rules and templates.\n\u2022 *Queue manager service* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], [PERSON_NAME_0029]): reliability for grants and timed events.\nSystems and analytics\n\u2022 *Algo Levels v2.1* ([PERSON_NAME_0050]): generate set, verify difficulty curve, flags.\n\u2022 *CPM_history metrics* (Leonard): lt_av[USERNAME_0903], lt_median, last_30, last_20, last_10 in dashboards by next release.\nNew live ops feature to port\n\u2022 *Axe Arena* ([PERSON_NAME_0092], [PERSON_NAME_0022]): win-streak multiplier scoring; port DD rules, adapt UI, add event config in HE, validate rewards loop.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 5, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_SLACK_ID", "EM