9", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "We started the meeting Leonard I'm taking notes for you guys.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "2efc947811769a89d3561ec48ce75bf9", "ts": "1758557310.184109", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Should we postpone or cancel? There are many bugs but prioritzation needs yours and [PERSON_NAME_0054]'s input I think", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "96854184420ae55547018ba8899ace66", "ts": "1758558164.541689", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "text": "*<!here>* We\u2019ve decided to postpone Axe Arena for the beta release. We\u2019ll be focusing on tech issues and bugs, so I wanted to share this update here as well", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 2, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "da49fe06f6c12f71c67a9da488b3f4a3", "ts": "1758558302.777379", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Here are the updates:\n\nArt:\n\n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0040] is working on new objects. \n\u2022 Martin has posted progress in the art channel. \n\u2022 Marcus is going through the polish list. \nEngineering:\n\n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0029] is working on the icons, (they need some feedback from [PERSON_NAME_0054]) after that he'll continue working on the queue manager. \n\u2022 Samuel is fixing the list of bugs [PERSON_NAME_0050] gave him. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0022] is clearing up the backlog of his various features that need improvements or bug cleaning. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0120]'s Infinite branch is ready to be merged, blessed by [PERSON_NAME_0050], and he's working on Apple/Google login. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0067] and Douglas feature completed Win and Collect, and will potentially give us a test today. But they anticipate some edge cases so this test isn't a final product test. \n\u2022 Douglas is dealing with other backend tasks, his plate is pretty full. \n", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-3", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "88b71a831aeb52c8a5c6a9a318d12475", "ts": "1758558433.169659", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "text": "We are coming", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "90d9a3a3720648e101f5301fb73225d7", "ts": "1758558456.692409", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm in prod", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}, {"id": "1b1fbfdcbf2490d96218cad6c0b56f2b", "ts": "1758558646.938559", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "text": "Everyone here: <https://meet.google.com/pew-jiyb-whp?authuser=1>", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": [{"fallback": "Meet", "from_url":